               Zheng, Hui and Zhang, Sihui and Wang, Yu and Huang, Ninghua and
               Du, Juan and Liu, Ya-Qiong and Lu, Qing-Bin and Cui, Fuqiang",
  abstract  = "BACKGROUND: Vaccination against coronavirus disease 2019
               (COVID-19) has become an important public health solution. To
               date, there has been a lack of data on COVID-19 vaccination
               willingness, vaccine hesitancy, and vaccination coverage in
               China since the vaccine has become available. METHODS: We
