               coverage was highest among persons aged $\geq$65 years (80.0\%)
               and lowest among persons aged 18-29 years (38.3\%). During the
               week beginning February 7, 2021, vaccination initiation among
               adults aged $\geq$65 years peaked at 8.2\%, whereas weekly
               initiation among other age groups peaked later and at lower
               levels. During April 19-May 22, 2021, the period following
